# Placeholder to keep the models/ directory structure in version control.
# Copy your offline OCR weights here before building a self-contained .exe:
#
#   models/
#   ├── det/    (text detection weights, e.g. inference.pdmodel)
#   ├── rec/    (recognition weights)
#   └── cls/    (textline orientation weights, optional)
#
# Binary weight files are ignored by .gitignore; only this file is tracked.
